<title>USA: Home Health buys RSD Management.</title>
<headline>Home Health buys RSD Management.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Penn. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Health Corp of America Inc said Monday it bought RSD Management Inc, a New Hampshire-based nursing company with annualized revenues of $18 million.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
